<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <p>
    We did not respond to the dispute on <%= @disputable.customer_email %>'s purchase of <%= @disputable.multiple_purchases? ? "the following items" : @disputable.purchase_for_dispute_evidence.link.name %> for <%= @disputable.formatted_disputed_amount %>.<% if (dispute_amount = @disputable.formatted_processor_dispute_amount) %> The dispute is for <%= dispute_amount %>.<% end %>
  </p>
  <% if @disputable.multiple_purchases? %>
    <% @disputable.disputed_purchases.each do |purchase| %>
      <p>
        <%= link_to purchase.link.name, purchase.link.long_url %>
      </p>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
  <p>
    The dispute will be lost.
    <% case @balance_debit %>
    <% when :full %>
      The amount we deducted for this sale stays deducted from your balance.
    <% when :partial %>
      The unrefunded part of this sale stays deducted from your balance.
    <% when :refunded %>
      This sale was already refunded in full, so nothing has been deducted from your balance.
    <% when :stripe_connect %>
      This sale was paid into your connected Stripe account, so nothing has been deducted from your Gumroad balance.
    <% else %>
      Nothing has been deducted from your balance.
    <% end %>
  </p>
  <p>
    We had no information about the sale from you, and for a dispute this small, our payment processor's fee to respond is more than we would usually recover.
  </p>
</div>
